description:
Technical Requirements:
- Strong knowledge of Python 3.x;
- Experience with Django REST Framework. GraphQL experience is also welcome;
- Familiarity with AWS or GCP or Azure;
- Experience with PostgreSQL or MySQL;
- Understanding of API design principles and RESTful APIs;
- Experience integrating LLM-powered features into products, including retrieval, AI agents, tool calling, and structured outputs;
- Hands-on experience with AI coding agents such as Claude Code;
- Experience with n8n or similar workflow automation tools, including building and maintaining automated workflows and integrating APIs and AI services;
- Basic knowledge of Git and Webpack;
- At least one year of commercial development experience.
Experience with React.js would be a significant advantage.
Non-Technical Qualifications and Skills:
- Strong written English and good spoken English communication skills;
- Understanding of the Scrum framework and team roles;
- Ability and willingness to learn quickly.
We Offer:
- Free English classes, technical lectures, and courses;
- 22 working days of paid annual leave;
- Paid sick leave without requiring a doctor's note;
- Flexible working hours: you can plan your workday as you prefer, provided you remain available for team collaboration and daily meetings;
About Us
AnvilEight is a Python development outsourcing company that provides custom software solutions and mobile development services to businesses and individuals.
We are a team of around 40 professionals who enjoy tackling challenging projects and delivering high-impact solutions to clients worldwide.
Our core technology stack includes Python 3.x, Django, and React.js. We also have a mobile development team specializing in iOS and Android applications.
We follow the Scrum framework, with structured backlogs and daily Scrum meetings.
